---
<BaseLayout title="About DOSU Optical" description="Learn about DOSU Optical, an independent optical practice in Taipan USJ focused on professional eye care and personalised consultation." path="/about"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'About'}]} /><section class="section"><div class="container max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl font-bold">Professional optical care in Subang Jaya</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg">DOSU Optical is an optical shop located in Taipan USJ 10, Subang Jaya, providing professional eye care and quality eyewear solutions for individuals and families..</p><p class="mt-4 text-lg">We believe choosing eyewear is more than purchasing a pair of glasses. Every customer deserves a comprehensive eye examination, personalised consultation, and professional recommendations based on their vision needs and lifestyle..</p><p class="mt-4 text-lg">Our services include eye examinations, prescription glasses, contact lenses, myopia management, progressive lenses, and carefully selected eyewear brands.</p><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">{['Our Mission: Accessible professional care','Our Vision: Trusted family eye care authority','Our Values: Clarity, honesty, after-sales care'].map((x)=><div class="card"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">{x}</h2></div>)}</div></div></section></BaseLayout>
